# @hub-lanes

# ── DEFER REPORT (BH-9426) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:17Z: for each project, which files made builds end BUILD_DEFERRED
# over the last DEFER_REPORT_WINDOW_DAYS (default 7), the ticket that held them,
# the wait each deferral added and deferrals per ticket. Read-only: one line per
# project in logs/defer-report.log and state/defer-report/<project>-top.txt, the
# list the planner prompt reads (bin/lib/defer-top.sh).
# Kill: flags/lane-off-defer-report, DEFER_REPORT_ENABLED=0, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off defer-report.
17 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/defer-report.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
